#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:33 0c96fd8d494144c1917b989bb4a8349c
#: 838989d6c7814da6b2b285df53bf27a9 a209a16388c945139fc4131ab265da05
#: a495a6c49a69418989e1190e260db439 f4bb03a051bd44478a1a0346e8f72d6d
#: fe27acd1510b4d6baf964afcd3532fbf
msgid ""
"If the autopilot is rebooted via MAVLink, it will lose communication with "
"the CRSF receiver until the receiver is power cycled. Also, the CRSF TX must"
" be transmitting BEFORE the receiver is powered up."
