#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-rc.rst:38 360a947d56634a17916f1042a6c24c92
msgid ""
"ELRS can be setup in the same manner as CRSF above , however, bit 13 of "
":ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` should be set to alter the baudrate from "
"416KBaud that CRSF uses, to 420KBaud that ELRS uses. As mentioned above, the"
" UART selected must have DMA capability. ELRS can also be configured to "
"output MAVLink, enabling full bidirectional Mavlink telemetry and RC control"
" over the same link. See :ref:`ELRS <common-rc-systems>` for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"ELRS 可以与上述 CRSF 相同的方式设置，但应将 :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 的第 13 位设置为 1，将波特率从"
" CRSF 使用的 416KBaud 更改为 ELRS 使用的 420KBaud。如上所述，所选 UART 必须具有 DMA 能力。ELRS "
"也可配置为输出 MAVLink，从而通过同一链路实现完整的双向 MAVLink 数传和 RC 控制。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`ELRS "
"<common-rc-systems>`。"

